## 14. Nuttige queries

**Hoe presteert een specifieke bot?**

```sql
SELECT
  COUNT(*) AS n,
  ROUND(AVG(f.fwd_ret_10d)::numeric, 3) AS gem,
  ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN f.fwd_ret_10d > 0 THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END)::numeric, 3) AS winrate
FROM selecties s
JOIN forward_returns f ON f.ticker = s.ticker AND f.datum = s.datum
WHERE s.strategie = 'bot_01kasstr'
  AND f.fwd_ret_10d IS NOT NULL
  AND s.datum >= '2026-08-15';
```

**Welke bots hebben vandaag picks?**

```sql
SELECT strategie, COUNT(*) AS n
FROM selecties
WHERE datum = CURRENT_DATE
GROUP BY strategie
ORDER BY n DESC;
```

**Zijn er dubbele combinaties?**

```sql
SELECT ticker, datum, strategie, COUNT(*)
FROM selecties
GROUP BY ticker, datum, strategie
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC
LIMIT 10;
```

